      <p class="Default"><span style="font-weight:bold;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000">Date and type of Hearing: </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000"> Hearing on the GRC &#8211; CVP on 11 January 2026.</span></p>
