	    <p><span style="font-weight:bold;font-family:'Book Antiqua'">[2] </span><span style="font-family:'Book Antiqua'">Bank Mellat v HM Treasury (No 2) <ref href="https://caselaw.nationalarchives.gov.uk/uksc/2013/39" uk:canonical="[2013] UKSC 39" uk:isNeutral="true" uk:origin="TNA" uk:type="case" uk:year="2013">[2013] UKSC 39</ref>, [20]&#8211;[21] (Lord Sumption); R (Lumsdon) v Legal Services Board <ref href="https://caselaw.nationalarchives.gov.uk/uksc/2015/41" uk:canonical="[2015] UKSC 41" uk:isNeutral="true" uk:origin="TNA" uk:type="case" uk:year="2015">[2015] UKSC 41</ref>, [33]&#8211;[38], [60]&#8211;[67] (structured proportionality and fair balance in professional regulation).</span></p>
